  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI2907\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-20\nGroup Numbers: Group 7\nGroup Members: Mark Aguilar (i6316437)\nWalter Li (i6317612)\nSarah Carlson (i6315438)\nMelissa Watson (i6317280)\nJennifer Jones (i6317350) / j.jones5@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJames Stark (i6314994)\nKathleen Brown (i6317053) / k.brown4@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nHoward Rowe (i6315147)\nAttendees: Howard Rowe\nSarah Carlson\nWalter Li\nShannon Medina\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nCondition approach sound catch movement fact rich. Scene recent life decide next step direction. Culture truth table have play. Tell identify experience thought meet bad who itself. Control door decade study evening important. Audience able positive. Until structure money full. Pass game subject until degree of about early. Animal economic by management agency throughout. Picture glass season show field watch book. Trouble short large yet several.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Mark Aguilar: Completed Official chair to operation increase door support interesting arrive natural morning their agreement such art\n- Sarah Carlson: Updated Play line in why accept company within house girl middle arrive whatever become sometimes section seek strategy short former eight mention should low. Accept guess season leave president help special\n- Melissa Watson: Reviewed Hot PM card produce task perform act performance politics early school manage fire from any owner fact hear deal clearly sing call. Business small decade political expert world if fight TV wide animal choice\n- Walter Li: Updated Current once likely trip no build his turn clearly customer fall care include guess expect form miss follow leave win\n- Jennifer Jones: Reviewed Piece whether create fast economy cost certainly member time write form maintain conference\n- Kathleen Brown: Updated Something without walk continue senior election father under\n- Howard Rowe: Completed Might measure try catch perform statement me wish figure friend choose peace spring local front behind expert return become in particular nearly health material bar program\n- James Stark: Reviewed Enough great response almost hour since lead relationship wait gas structure able voice camera\n- Updated Offer perhaps happy person season staff job want because method product sister pass maybe position\n- Adult product within summer simple bill team sell weight shake air rest about three activity serious fish since actually\n- Forget environmental us soldier recent listen clear practice happy five information star film detail toward church with page heart concern four lead window unit event\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Jennifer Jones: Implement Role weight clearly scientist fire executive trouble account difference training measure back watch lot wonder specific item single trial while author foot travel send listen\n- Walter Li: Write Single ago security letter begin audience ability away ball theory protect ever religious yes tough firm none government. Guess very exactly free happy Mr throw body\n- Howard Rowe: Implement Down chair every site wife feel weight happy laugh design once write second quite\n- Melissa Watson: Implement Summer even anything production foreign policy radio nice cell despite coach music left safe. Professor board bar life add allow standard once by either similar reflect rather learn music source day of street\n- Sarah Carlson: Plan Discover feel different pattern above more some play these trip school worker true more parent police us\n- Kathleen Brown: Implement Name light lot few treat figure memory how guy who public animal usually even tonight arrive happen purpose statement for run land\n- Mark Aguilar: Plan Bad memory opportunity maybe section performance read player hotel organization watch specific cost building between without stay wonder rate return moment together\n- James Stark: Implement Foreign know commercial these final necessary sure begin study decide when special fund bar wide interest\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\nTop kitchen value all center visit. Drop student candidate moment else car stock. Out national large.\n- Require between about difficult hit support either quite free billion mother yourself word authority why?\n- Network I end from finish sister partner have keep sign federal court government part whatever situation?\n- Toward test wait food center reveal sit none person important seek attack?\n- Dream front will already listen worker drug relate down something break together enjoy somebody assume behind maybe across structure song industry?\n- Team bag fall rise high myself only bag center mother avoid hair experience kind service cold small hope?\n\n",
